msgstr "2. Ativar Turbo + recursos de Vídeo"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/dashboard.rs:1343
msgid "3. Launch from Dashboard"
msgstr "3. Iniciar pelo Dashboard"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-core/src/health.rs:464
#: bigame-engine/bigame-core/src/health.rs:467
